OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council leader jailed for fraud
OL,4,Aand tax evasion                        
OL,6,FA former council leader has been jailed
OL,7,Fafter he was found guilty of fraud and 
OL,8,Ftax evasion.                           
OL,10,FEx-Ashfield District Council leader and
OL,11,FNottinghamshire county councillor Jason
OL,12,FZadrozny was convicted on 21 September 
OL,13,Fafter setting up a fake heritage group 
OL,14,Fto defraud the county council out of   
OL,15,Fthousands of pounds.                   
OL,17,FSentencing Zadrozny at Northampton     
OL,18,FCrown Court on Friday, Judge David     
OL,19,FHerbert told the defendant he had      
OL,20,F"failed the electorate and harmed      
OL,21,Fpublic confidence in the council".     
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
