OL,3,GNEWSAEx-council leader jailed for fraud
OL,4,Aand tax evasion                        
OL,6,FThe 46-year-old, of Stanton Hill, who  
OL,7,Fserved as an Ashfield Independents     
OL,8,Fcouncillor on the county council, was  
OL,9,Fjailed for 27 months for nine counts of
OL,10,Ffraud and four counts of tax evasion.  
